    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the tiny shifts don't really matter though. it's like, i fix one thing and then three more things break. it just feels doomed from the start. like no matter what i do, the outcome is always the same. it's just this constant weight and i'm just so sick of carrying it. i'm just so tired of the fight.",
